1. About This License

RGB-LED-REMOTE is an Android application developed using Flutter. It is designed to control compatible RGB LED strip lights and bulbs through supported infrared (IR) hardware and related control functionality.

This project is distributed as free and open-source software under the GNU General Public License, version 3, or (at your option) any later version.

The purpose of this license is to allow users, developers, students, researchers, and organizations to use, study, modify, share, and redistribute the covered software while preserving the same freedoms for downstream recipients.

The term "free software" refers to freedom to use, study, modify, and share the software, not necessarily to a zero purchase price.

